5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I hate doing math before turning on the lights. Let's make sure we don't freeze next winter.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the actual yearly cost before agreeing to anything. The current split feels arbitrary.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is actually doing the math every month? It takes forever and someone always gets it wrong.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We set this up when three people lived here. It’s unfair now. Let’s check if the usage is actually equal.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"The reminders are making us avoid each other. I want to fix the tension, not just the bill.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,@Rin I agree. I don't want to be the one checking the meter every day.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,@Shunichi That is a fair point. I want to know the upfront cost of changing the system too.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,@Mio Exactly. I want to know how much time this will eat into our evenings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,@Ryuji I can look into the metering costs. It seems the most logical way to verify usage.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,@Rin I worry about the social cost. Let's look at how other houses handle this.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I think we should look at the winter habits. I want to know if people are actually saving.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the last twelve statements. I need to see the variance in the bills.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the trial run of the reconciliation template. I want to see the workload.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the plug-in monitor readings. I want to see the actual room-by-room usage.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the payment log. I want to see if the delays are causing the conflict.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
