60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A sounds best to me. No more checking meters, no more anxiety.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B is the only one that is truly fair, but the 170k yen upfront cost is a barrier.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option C is the status quo. It causes the most conflict. I want to avoid that.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the logical choice. The data proves the usage is unequal. We should pay for what we use.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A might reduce the social tension. If the amount is fixed, there is less to argue about.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,@Ryuji I understand the cost concern. But the mental load of Option B is also high.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,@Mio The mental load is manageable if the system is clear. The financial risk of A is higher for me.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,@Shunichi I am worried about the 40 minutes of logging. Who will do that?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin We can rotate it. Or use a template. The trial run was bad, but we can improve it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,@Rin The payment log shows that delays happen when people question the amount. Option A fixes the amount.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I am leaning towards A. It feels more like a home, less like a business.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am still leaning towards B. Fairness is important. But I will consider A if the winter rate is high.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,I am leaning towards A. I don't want to do the logging.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting for B. It is the only way to be truly fair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I am voting for A. I want to reduce the conflict.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
